   {
    "text": "Want to switch between Jason and Lucia in GTA 6? Here's how."
   },
   {
    "text": "Hold right on the D-pad to open the partner menu, then press R1 or RB."
   },
   {
    "text": "It unlocks with the story, so you can't swap from the very start."
   },
   {
    "text": "And missions marked J or L are for one character only."
   },
   {
    "text": "Team Jason or team Lucia? Follow for more GTA 6 tips."
   }
